  "description": "A popular internet communication format where a visual image is paired with a text overlay to convey a humorous, ironic, or relatable message. This format is widely used across social media platforms and relies on the audience's familiarity with internet culture and the conventions of meme creation. The text 'when your kitten can't find a box' is a classic example of a 'relatable' meme, which evokes laughter by tapping into a shared experience or common pet-owner sentiment.",
